WEBVTT

00:04:28.845 --> 00:04:30.762
gjithmone do te kete nje element te tyre

00:04:30.762 --> 00:04:33.894
qe kerkojne rrugen si nje menyre per te shpetuar,

00:04:33.894 --> 00:04:38.952
nje liri, dhe sigurisht nje rebelim,

00:04:38.952 --> 00:04:40.968
Falemnderit.

00:04:40.968 --> 00:04:43.237
(Duartrokitje)